edia/viewed.263ef266.svg)\n\n  View](/rera-pdf/arkade-evoke-goregaon-west-residential/arkade-evoke-goregaon-rera-certificate)\n\n  ![Download](/_next/static/media/download.00cfc42e.svg)\n\n  Download\n\n### Arkade Evoke - Project Information\n\n### Project Type\n\nResidential\n\n### Project Sub Type\n\nApartmentNew Launch\n\n### City\n\nMumbai\n\n### Possession Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\n### Possession Date\n\nJun 30, 2029\n\n### Built Date\n\nJun 1, 2029\n\n### Land Type\n\nGroup Housing\n\n### Electricity Supply\n\nYes\n\n### Arkade Evoke - Overview\n\nExplore Arkade Evoke, an under-construction residential project located in Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai, spanning an area of 1.09 acres and built by the Arkade Group. The project features large 2 & 3 BHK flats amidst landscaped greens, ideal for city home buyers and investors looking for a classy residence in one of Mumbai's centrally located west suburbs.\n\nIt is not always easy to find a home which is spacious and provides you with a landscaped life amidst the crowded skyline of Goregaon. It is for this reason that Arkade Evoke should be your best option, comprising a G+21-floor single-tower structure.\n\n## **About The Project**\n\nArkade Evoke has been conceptualized in keeping with the ideas of natural light, ventilation, and subtle luxury. With the experience of 40 years of Arkade Group and more than 32 successful projects in Mumbai, they have come up with Arkade Evoke, which comprises 2 BHK flats of around 746 sq. ft. and 3 BHK flats of 1,141 sq. ft. to 1,234 sq. ft., along with twin flats.\n\nBangur Nagar has gained popularity as one of the in-demand areas because of its proximity to Link Road, S.V. Road, Western Express Highway, Goregaon Railway Station, and Bangur Nagar Metro Station, which is merely 850 meters away from here. The area gets an added convenience of being close to Inorbit Mall, Mindspace, Infinity IT Park, and Oberoi Mall.\n\nThe project provides more than 20 facilities such as a swimming pool, clubhouse, gymnasium, yoga deck, jogging track, children’s play area, senior citizen seats, and a multi-purpose hall that come with landscaping courtyards. The project is an attractive investment for urban homeowners due to the reputation of the developer and well-established micro-market, making it a good selection in Goregaon West, Mumbai.\n\n## **Why Invest in this Project?**\n\nThe biggest strength of Arkade Evoke is that it provides buyers with an excellent chance to invest in landscaped, low-density homes in one of the most well-established western suburbs of Mumbai. Developed by an experienced developer, the project features spacious 2 and 3 BHK flats made with comfort and sustainability in mind. The good connectivity to the metro and highways makes Arkade Evoke a great investment in Goregaon West, Mumbai.\n\n### Arkade Evoke - Amenities\n\n![24*7 Water Supply](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbuilding.9ba55e7b.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n24\\*7 Water Supply\n\n![Badminton Court](/_next/static/media/badminton.d08ebb3b.svg)\n\nBadminton Court\n\n![Car Parking](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbuilding.9ba55e7b.png&w=128&q=75)\n\nCar Parking\n\n![Club House](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbuilding.9ba55e7b.png&w=128&q=75)\n\nClub House\n\n![Fire Fighting Equipments](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbuilding.9ba55e7b.png&w=128&q=75)\n\nFire Fighting Equipments\n\n![Gymnasium](/_next/static/media/Gymnasium.3e4fc049.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![Indoor Games](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbuilding.9ba55e7b.png&w=128&q=75)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![Intercom Facility](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbuilding.9ba55e7b.png&w=128&q=75)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![Jogging Track](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbuilding.9ba55e7b.png&w=128&q=75)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![Kids Pool](/_next/static/media/pool.b3e6c49b.svg)\n\nKids Pool\n\n![Lift](/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FLift