n\n1 KM | 5 Minutes\n\n---\n\nArkade Evoke at Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West is a premium residential redevelopment project by Arkade, designed to elevate urban living with a perfect blend of elegance, space, and modern aesthetics. Spanning a thoughtfully planned 1.1-acre land parcel, the project features stylish G+21 storey towers that redefine the skyline of Goregaon West. The development reflects Arkade’s commitment to quality construction, refined detailing, and contemporary architecture, making it an ideal choice for discerning homebuyers seeking a sophisticated lifestyle in a well-established neighborhood.  \n  \nThe project offers spacious 2 and 3 BHK residences that are intelligently planned to maximize natural light, ventilation, and usable space. Each home is crafted with a focus on functionality and comfort, complemented by premium finishes and modern layouts. From well-designed living areas to carefully planned bedrooms and kitchens, every element contributes to a refined living experience that balances aesthetics with everyday practicality.  \n  \nLocated in Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West, Arkade Evoke enjoys excellent connectivity to major commercial hubs, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and entertainment zones. The strategic location, combined with thoughtfully curated amenities and serene surroundings, ensures a balanced lifestyle that blends urban convenience with peaceful living. Arkade Evoke stands as a timeless residential address for those who appreciate quality, design, and long-term value.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Arkade Evoke Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Arkade Evoke in Goregaon West, Mumbai - Image 900624](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/152967/BHK_Configuration/2-bhk-735-ca-1775635730.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n735 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.68 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Arkade Evoke in Goregaon West, Mumbai - Image 900625](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/152967/BHK_Configuration/3-bhk-1141-ca-1775635737.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1141 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n4.1 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Arkade Evoke in Goregaon West, Mumbai - Image 900626](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/152967/BHK_Configuration/3-bhk-1234-ca-1775635742.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1234 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n4.44 Cr\n\n## Key Features of Arkade Evoke Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Best Amenities.\n* High Security.\n* Panoramic View.\n* Prime Location.\n* Magnificent Structure.\n* Spacious And Luxury Rooms.\n\n## Amenities Arkade Evoke Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* 24X7 Water Supply\n* Lift\n* Security\n* Power Back Up\n* Visitor Parking\n* Yoga Room\n* Mud Playing Zone\n* Meditation Zone\n* Pets Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Dth And Broadband Connection\n* Senior Citizens Walking Track\n* Multipurpose Hall\n* Society Office\n* Medical Room\n* Convenience Store\n* Healthcare Facility\n\n* Club House\n* Reserved Parking\n* Maintenance Staff\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* 24/7 Security\n* Fireplace\n\n* Kids Play Area\n* Game Corners\n* Indoor Games\n* Cricket Ground\n* Multipurpose Play Court\n* Jogging Track\n* Gymnasium\n* Cycle Track\n* Carrom\n\n* Community Club\n* Recreation/Kids Club\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Mini Theatre\n* Vaastu-Compliant Designs\n* Gym\n* Nature Walkway\n* Sand Pit\n* Green Wall\n\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Organic Waste Convertor\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n* Fruit Bearing Trees\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Laminate finish doors\n* Smart switches\n* Modular kitchen\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Aluminium sliding windows\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Wash Basin\n* False Ceiling\n* TV Point\n* Telephone point\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Multi-stranded cables\n* Acrylic Emulsion Paint\n* Concealed Drainage System\n* Plaster\n* Geyser Point\n\n## Google Map Location of Arkade Evoke Goregaon West\n\n## Locality Overview of Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Goregaon West](/location-review/mumbai/goregaon-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Goregaon West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Goregaon West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nArkade Evoke is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [PR1180002502642](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=PR1180002502642)\n\nProject: Arkade Evoke\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Arkade Evoke Goregaon West\n\n---\n\n* The Hub Mall\n* Metro Store\n* Harmony Mall\n* Shagun Mall\n\n* Surbhi Sweets And Snacks\n* Little China\n* The Green Door\n* Gaon Gajali\n\n* Vibgyor High School\n* Lords College\n* Patkar College\n* St. Thomas Junior College\n\n* Baliga Nursing Home\n* Kapadia Multispeciality Hospital\n* Suvidha Hospital & Polyclinic\n* Ashtavinayak Nursing Home Private Limited\n\n![Arkade Developers](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/666_1678040176_crown.webp)\n\n## [Arkade Developers](/mumbai/sale/builder/arkade-developers-666)\n\nOngoing Projects: 14\n\nTotal Projects: 14\n\n---\n\nConsistent endeavours to bring futuristic developments whilst leaving behind the footprints of excellency, Arkade Developers set off as a brand, synonyms for trust, quality, assurance, ethics, transparency and affordability.   \n  \nTheir projects are the fine specimen of the highest standard that exceptionally exceeds the aspirations of customers. For three consistent decades, Arkade developers have been building masterpieces that seemingly add value to people's lives. They work on a mission to deliver exemplary experiences through their developments.  \n  \n  \n[Properties in Thane by Arkade Developers](https://houssed.com/thane/sale/builder/arkade-developers-666), [Properties in Palghar by Arkade Developers](https://houssed.com/palghar/sale/builder/arkade-developers-666), [Properties in Mumbai by Arkade Developers](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/arkade-developers-666)\n\n## About Arkade Evoke, Mumbai, Goregaon West\n\n---\n\nArkade Evoke is a **[residential flat project located in Goregaon West](https://houssed.com/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats), Mumbai**, developed by **Arkade Developers** and marked as **RERA approved**.\n\nThe project offers **2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments** with carpet areas ranging from **745 sq ft to 1240 sq ft**, making it suitable for buyers looking for **mid-sized homes in a well-connected suburban location**.\n\nThis project targets buyers who want **practical layouts within Mumbai’s western corridor**, where connectivity and daily convenience are key decision factors.\n\n---\n\n# Why Arkade Evoke Gets Attention in Goregaon West\n\nGoregaon West is a high-demand residential zone with limited availability of well-planned new developments.\n\nArkade Evoke stands out due to:\n\n• Carpet area-based sizing for usable space clarity  \n • 2 BHK and 3 BHK options in a space-constrained city  \n • Location within Mumbai’s **Western suburban belt**  \n • Suitable for buyers prioritising **connectivity + livability**\n\nThis makes it relevant for both **end-use buyers and long-term investors**.\n\n---\n\n# Who Should Consider Arkade Evoke\n\nThis project is suitable for:\n\n• Buyers looking for **2 or 3 BHK [flats in Goregaon West](https://houssed.com/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/property/flat)**  \n • Working professionals needing **connectivity across Mumbai**  \n • Families planning **long-term residential use**  \n • Buyers upgrading from **smaller apartments**\n\n**Less suitable for:**\n\n• Buyers looking for 1 BHK or [**compact budget units**](https://houssed.com/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)  \n • Those seeking [**ultra-luxury**](https://houssed.com/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury) or [**large-format apartments**](https://houssed.com/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/4-plus-bhk)  \n • Buyers focused only on [**low-cost housing options**](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n\n---\n\n# Location Advantage – Living in Goregaon West\n\nGoregaon West is one of Mumbai’s key residential locations due to its connectivity and access to commercial hubs.\n\n**Key location benefits:**\n\n• Connectivity via **Western Express Highway and SV Road**  \n • Access to **railway station (Goregaon)**  \n • Proximity to business hubs like **[Malad](https://houssed.com/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats), [Andheri](https://houssed.com/mumbai-andheri.west/sale/flats), and [BKC](https://houssed.com/mumbai-bandra.west/sale/flats) (via road connectivity)**  \n • Availability of schools, hospitals, malls, and daily essentials\n\nThis makes the area suitable for professionals working across different parts of Mumbai.\n\n---\n\n# Configuration Breakdown – Practical Space Analysis\n\n| Configuration | Carpet Area | Practical Use |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [**2 BHK**](https://houssed.com/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/2bhk) | ~745 sq ft | Suitable for small families and working professionals |\n| [**3 BHK**](https://houssed.com/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/3bhk) | ~1240 sq ft | Suitable for larger families or space upgrades |\n\n**Practical insight:**\n\n• Carpet area clarity helps understand actual usable space  \n • 3 BHK offers flexibility for work-from-home or additional room needs  \n • Balanced sizing for Mumbai standards where space is limited\n\n---\n\n# Daily Living Reality\n\n**What supports daily life:**\n\n• Strong public transport access  \n • Established residential infrastructure  \n • Access to shopping, healthcare, and education\n\n**What buyers should verify:**\n\n• Traffic congestion during peak hours  \n • Parking allocation details  \n • Water supply and building infrastructure  \n • Noise levels due to urban density\n\n---\n\n# Cost of Living – What to Expect\n\nLiving in Goregaon West involves ongoing costs such as:\n\n• Monthly maintenance charges  \n • Electricity and water bills  \n • Parking costs (if applicable)  \n • Routine upkeep and repairs\n\nMumbai’s western suburbs generally have **higher living costs compared to developing areas**.\n\n---\n\n# Arkade Evoke vs Older Buildings in Goregaon\n\n| Factor | Arkade Evoke | Older Buildings Nearby |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Construction | Planned residential project | Older standalone buildings |\n| Layout | Standardised 2 & 3 BHK | Varies significantly |\n| Space Efficiency | Carpet-based clarity | Often unclear usable space |\n| Infrastructure | Modern | Depends on building age |\n| Availability | Developer inventory | Mostly resale |\n\nThis comparison is important for buyers choosing between **[new developments](https://houssed.com/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/possession/new-projects) and [resale properties](https://houssed.com/buy/resale/residential/mumbai-goregaon.west)**.\n\n---\n\n# Work-From-Home & Future Living\n\n• 2 BHK supports basic work-from-home setups  \n • 3 BHK allows dedicated workspace  \n • Suitable for long-term adaptability as family needs grow\n\n---\n\n# Project Status & Key Checks\n\nArkade Evoke is marked as **RERA approved**.\n\nBefore proceeding, buyers should:\n\n• Verify RERA details on the official portal  \n • Confirm construction stage  \n • Check possession timeline  \n • Validate current inventory availability\n\n---\n\n# After Moving In – What Residents Typically Experience\n\n• Lift usage during peak hours  \n • Parking access and convenience  \n • Noise levels in a dense urban setting  \n • Maintenance quality of the society\n\nA site visit helps assess these real-world factors.\n\n---\n\n# Final Verdict – Should You Consider Arkade Evoke?\n\nArkade Evoke in Goregaon West is a [**mid-segment residential project**](https://houssed.com/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/budget/between-50-lakh-to-1-cr) offering **2 and 3 BHK flats with practical carpet areas**.\n\nIt is suitable for buyers who:\n\n• Want to live in a **well-connected Mumbai suburb**  \n • Prefer **usable layouts over compact designs**  \n • Are planning for **end-use or long-term investment**\n\nBuyers should evaluate **location convenience, layout efficiency, and project status** before making a final decision.\n\n## FAQ's about Arkade Evoke Goregaon West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Goregaon West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Goregaon West\n\n* [Apartments in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n* [Penthouse in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/property/penthouse)\n* [Studio Apartment in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/property/studio-apartment)\n\n### Explore Projects in Goregaon West\n\n* [New Projects in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Pre Launch Projects in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/possession/pre-launch)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Goregaon West](/mumbai-goregaon.west/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move)\n\n### Homes by B