ingcdn.com/demand/s/client/common/assets/wallsCeilingTab.31601368.svg)\n\n### Arkade Evoke Ratings & Reviews Goregaon West\n\n## Arkade Evoke Ratings & Reviews\n\n### Ratings based on features\n\n4.7/5\n\n4.7/5\n\n4.7/5\n\n4.7/5\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  1 year ago\n\n**1 User** found this review helpful\n\n#### Good things here\n\nApartments in Imperial heights are spacious and the layout is really great. All Apartments (specially in towers A&B) have large balconies.\nMetro station on link road side is walking distance. The other one on NESCO is also close by which provides great connectivity. The only downside is proximity to Oshiwara Nalla which is also getting fixed as part of the Oshiwara River rejuvenation project . The society also has great amenities including clubhouse , swimming pool , Basketball , Tennis and Pickel ball courts etc. There are 3 Gyms which are fully equipped along with separate Yoga rooms . There is also large space in the common areas between Lobbys which is very unlike typical Mumbai Apartment complexesread more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nProximity to Oshiwara Nalla... waiting for the STPs to come online in the next one year which will rejuvenate the Oshiwara riverread more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  2 years ago\n\n#### Good things here\n\nsafe for family or single woman, no power cut in society, 2 metro station are near from society and many more facilityread more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nnot applicable......................................................................................read more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  2 years ago\n\n#### Good things here\n\nSchool and restaurant are easily accessible. this is great place and great cleanliness. All are very near such as school restaurant park and hospital. No any crimes .read more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nI have not faced any type of issues because this is the best location in Goregaon West. all are very clean and well furnished. I never disappoint from this location.read more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  2 years ago\n\n#### Good things here\n\nI feel safe and secure at night with my family.The society is very neat and clean.The society is vey hygienic.There are best quality street lights.I am welling to walk at night.read more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nThere is good transportation facilities.Thanks for wonderful houseThe society was very friendly and very humble.read more\n\n![]()\n\nOwner |  2 years ago\n\n#### Good things here\n\nThe society offers excellent facilities such as a gym and swimming pool, and cleanliness and maintenance are top-notch.read more\n\n#### Things need improvement\n\nThe only drawback was the connectivity, with limited availability of public transport and the metro being quite far from the society.read more\n\n48 Reviews\n\n## Price Trends for Goregaon West\n\n+\n\nADD MORE\n\nto compare\n\n## Arkade Evoke Official Brochure\n\n![Arkade Evoke Brochure 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/d55e2f2926c491c9d3cca9dfacc49b6e/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Arkade Evoke Brochure 2](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/e9497d8cc955caa36942cd4e4e991c4f/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Arkade Evoke Brochure 3](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/e683f86cd48c2158c3456d65b777a984/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Arkade Evoke Brochure 4](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/0047af629506a8ad8d654cfc93b903ce/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Arkade Evoke Brochure 5](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/e3cd173aae877cf34e859e72b5ca3796/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Arkade Evoke Brochure 6](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/1c8a9baaba8cc371a0b0871296a917f4/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Arkade Evoke Brochure 7](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/8d39ea846793ab7a33e0170aa6d98abf/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Arkade Evoke Brochure 8](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/b8b1f73f15b7a705c8477628f046b917/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Arkade Evoke Brochure 9](https://housing-images.n7net.in/d9dd8fcc/6e0b1af949a344e18ada1087ced4e0f6/v0/medium.jpg)\n![Arkade Evoke Brochure 10](https://housing-ima