le-goregaon_west-Mumbai-others.jpg)\n![2 BHK Flat](https://housing-images.n7net.in/01c16c28/c2dfb2d8b76f86b1d4e38cec1fc8e258/v0/medium/2_bhk_apartment-for-sale-goregaon_west-Mumbai-others.jpg)\n![2 BHK Flat](https://housing-images.n7net.in/01c16c28/65eada9fea1442b71d059e0438d3145e/v0/medium/2_bhk_apartment-for-sale-goregaon_west-Mumbai-others.jpg)\n![3 BHK Flat](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/4e593588b1d06f2ae18d53ee0a4a71a6/v0/medium.jpeg)\n![3 BHK Flat](https://housing-images.n7net.in/01c16c28/591fbfa6c4ca8d2d88a5e181c6597cbc/v0/medium/3_bhk_apartment-for-sale-goregaon_west-Mumbai-others.jpg)\n![2 BHK Flat](https://housing-images.n7net.in/01c16c28/591fbfa6c4ca8d2d88a5e181c6597cbc/v0/medium/2_bhk_apartment-for-sale-goregaon_west-Mumbai-others.jpg)\n![3 BHK Flat](https://housing-images.n7net.in/01c16c28/3105be1259b6daee3c87a2533268baf0/v0/medium/3_bhk_apartment-for-sale-goregaon_west-Mumbai-hall.jpg)\n![2 BHK Flat](https://housing-images.n7net.in/01c16c28/8ea2b34a27ca471bd856510e78c671d7/v0/medium/2_bhk_apartment-for-sale-goregaon_west-Mumbai-hall.jpg)\n\n## About the Developer of Arkade Evoke\n\n![AD]()\n\n### [Arkade Developers](/buy-projects-by-arkade-developers-bid-1156565-Ainjkptt84zvb67gr9egi5ayue) 1986 Year estd. 44 Projects\n\nArkade Developers, a premier real estate developer and listed entity on BSE and NSE with a rich legacy of over 38+ years, is celebrated for creating opulent residential properties.  \n  \nFor Arkade Developers, constructing quality homes is driven by passion rather than just a profession. This philosophy has been guided by CMD, Mr. Amit Jain, leading Arkade Developers to become one of Mumbai's most esteemed real estate firms. Under their leadership, Arkade Developers has significantly impacted the city, consistently showcasing excellence.  \n  \nCommitted to the 'Family First' principle, Arkade Developers upholds the core values of Trust, Transparency, Commitment, and Happiness. Every property bearing the Arkade name represents the pinnacle of quality, consistently surpassing customer expectations.  \n  \n38+ years of legacy | 30 projects completed | 5.5+ Mn sq. ft. developed | 2+ Mn sq. ft. under development | 5,500+ Happy Families | Listed Entity on BSE & NSE\n\n![Arkade Prime](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/25bbe00fa83d28e2dc46194d0f497dd8/v0/medium/arkade_prime-andheri_east-mumbai-arkade_developers.jpeg)\n![Arkade Aspire](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/e76de210bf1562d3a6ccc0fc96171667/v0/medium/arkade_aspire-goregaon_east-mumbai-arkade_developers.jpeg)\n![Arkade Earth Hazel](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/73fb2cd1ed18cf28c7db38ebd9c20f0f/v0/medium/arkade_earth_hazel-kanjurmarg_east_1-mumbai-arkade_developers.jpeg)\n![Arkade Earth Gardenia](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/3dccb781ca42c074252b5d63c5fdc599/v2/medium/arkade_earth_gardenia-kanjurmarg_east_1-mumbai-arkade_developers.jpg)\n![Arkade Earth Daffodil](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/c35940c62f5113392ec4b77ccf3890ba/v2/medium/arkade_earth_daffodil-kanjurmarg_east_1-mumbai-arkade_developers.jpeg)\n![Arkade Art Phase 1](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/85abc4a3a975d0f5dd58ce8e32995fc5/v0/medium/arkade_art_phase_1-mira_road_east-mumbai-arkade_developers.jpeg)\n![Arkade Earth Wing Carnation](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/f3140c760762df094d9497aae2084d88/v2/medium/arkade_earth_wing_carnation-kanjurmarg_east_1-mumbai-arkade_developers.jpeg)\n![Arkade Earth Wing Bluebell](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/3dccb781ca42c074252b5d63c5fdc599/v2/medium/arkade_earth_wing_bluebell-kanjurmarg_east_1-mumbai-arkade_developers.jpg)\n![Arkade Earth Wing Aspen](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/3dccb781ca42c074252b5d63c5fdc599/v2/medium/arkade_earth_wing_aspen-kanjurmarg_east_1-mumbai-arkade_developers.jpg)\n![Arkade Crown](https://housing-images.n7net.in/4f2250e8/abf8354058a3b353186301dda0715eee/v0/medium/arkade_crown-borivali_west_1-mumbai-arkade_developers.png)\n\n