Normal Park / Central Green. The locality has a livability index of 4.3 and a lifestyle index of 4.2, promising a well-rounded living environment. The homes start from 746 Sq.Ft. to 1234 Sq.Ft..\n\n![Arkade Evoke Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/arkade-evoke-project-project-large-image1-3647-opt-c75b9731-6102-4ad8-b813-7615ba802861.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Arkade Evoke Apartment Exteriors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/arkade-evoke-project-apartment-exteriors1-8131-opt-34c8b964-cf9c-46d9-9c90-751135c06e43.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Arkade Evoke Apartment Exteriors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/arkade-evoke-project-apartment-exteriors4-6134-opt-878fa53c-ad2d-435c-9bea-e678651cfb8b.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Arkade Evoke Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-arkade-evoke-project-flagship-opt-20d92578-4ccb-4d12-bc5f-e7490dc04368.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹2.90 Cr - 4.80 Cr**\n\n₹39,250 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Arkade Evoke?\n\n## About Arkade Evoke, Goregaon West by Arkade Group\n\nArkade Evoke is a residential development by Arkade Group, located at Goregaon West Mumbai with pincode 400104. The project is spread across 1.08 Acres and offers 2, 3 BHK Flats. This development features 145 residential units.\n\nIt offers 2, 3 BHK with a starting unit area of 746 Sq.Ft. and an ending unit area of 1234 Sq.Ft.. The specifications include Oil Bound Distemper, Vitrified Tiles, RCC Frame Structure, designed to cater to modern living. Residents will enjoy a connectivity index of 4.2 and an education & healthcare index of 4.5. This property is categorized as Residential and is RERA approved with PR1180002502642. There are 1 residential blocks.\n\nThe average asking price in the locality is ₹ 32,500 /Sq.Ft., while the micromarket average is ₹ 35,900 /Sq.Ft.. The average rental price overall in the locality is ₹ 99 /Sq.Ft. and the average rental price, BHK-wise, is STUDIO with price ₹ 26 K, 1 BHK with price ₹ 40.4 K, 2 BHK with price ₹ 64.8 K, 3 BHK with price ₹ 97.3 K, 4 BHK with price ₹ 1.5 L. The developer brings 42 successful developments. Offering 3 different configurations, the unit types available include 2 BHK Apartment with area 746 Sq. Ft., 3 BHK Apartment with area 1141 Sq. Ft., and 3 BHK Apartment with area 1234 Sq. Ft..\n\n## Arkade Evoke Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Arkade Evoke.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  746 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.90 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1141 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 4.44 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1234 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 4.80 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nArkade Evoke's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter, compared with Goregaon West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Arkade Evoke | Goregaon West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 39250 | 33300 |\n| Mar 2026 | 40950 | 32500 |\n| Dec 2025 | 0 | 33650 |\n| Sep 2025 | 0 | 33050 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nArkade Evoke avg. price is ₹ 39.2 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Goregaon West at ₹ 33.3 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Kalpataru Vian](https://www.squareyards.com/kalpataru-vian-andheri-west-mumbai-npd-344520 \"Kalpataru Vian\") | ₹ 40,800 |\n| Current Project **Arkade Evoke** | ₹ 39,250 |\n| [Mahindra Marina 64](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mahindra-marina-64/339293/project \"Mahindra Marina 64\") | ₹ 35,600 |\n| Goregaon West | ₹ 33,300 |\n| [LnT Ahana](https://www.squareyards.com/lnt-ahana-malad-east-mumbai-npd-344396 \"LnT Ahana\") | ₹ 27,900 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Goregaon West ranges from ₹ 26 K to ₹ 1.5 L with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Arkade Evoke | In Goregaon West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 40.4 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 64.8 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 97.3 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.5 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Arkade Evoke.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\n## Arkade Evoke Floor Plans\n\nArkade Evoke offers 2, 3 BHK Flats designed for comfortable living. The available options include 2 BHK Apartment with 746 Sq. Ft. and.\n\nAlso available are 3 BHK Apartment with 1141 Sq. Ft. and.\n\nFurthermore, the development features 3 BHK Apartment with 1234 Sq. Ft. and.\n\nThese units provide a variety of choices to suit different needs. The 2, 3 BHK are designed for optimal space utilization. These homes offer modern layouts with ample natural light.\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 746 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Arkade Evoke, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/arkade-evoke-apartment-2-bhk-746sqft-20263509103505.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.90 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1234 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Arkade Evoke, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/arkade-evoke-apartment-3-bhk-1234sqft-20260909100944.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 4.80 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1141 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Arkade Evoke, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/arkade-evoke-apartment-3-bhk-1141sqft-20261909101911.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 4.44 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Arkade Evoke\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Arkade Evoke to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Arkade Evoke Apartment Exteriors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/arkade-evoke-project-apartment-exteriors1-8131-opt-34c8b964-cf9c-46d9-9c90-751135c06e43.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Arkade Evoke Apartment Exteriors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/arkade-evoke-project-apartment-exteriors4-6134-opt-878fa53c-ad2d-435c-9bea-e678651cfb8b.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Arkade Evoke Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-arkade-evoke-project-flagship-opt-20d92578-4ccb-4d12-bc5f-e7490dc04368.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload brochure & master plan of Arkade Evoke to explore floor plans and layout details in Goregaon West, Mumbai.\n\n### Project Brochure\n\nComplete details about the Project\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Arkade Evoke\n\nResidents at Arkade Evoke can enjoy Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Indoor Games, Normal Park / Central Green. It is designed to enhance community living with facilities catering to all age groups. Homebuyers can expect a blend of leisure and recreation. These amenities provide opportunities for relaxation and social interaction. This development aims to create a vibrant and engaging environment for all residents.\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-partyhal-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Arkade Group Goregaon West\n\nArkade Evoke is situated in Goregaon West, Mumbai and enjoys excellent connectivity. The locality is ranked 69.**New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road** offer smooth commutes to key destinations.\n\nResidents benefit from the close proximity to **Bangur Nagar Vidya Bhavan, StThomas School, Mitha Nagar Bmc School, Vibgyor High School, Vidyaniketan Primary School** and **Oriental Bank Of Commerce, Oriental Bankof Commerce?, ICICI Bank, Abhyudaya Co-Operative BankLtd, Syndicate Bank** The presence of **Vibgyor High School, Goregaon West, Inorbit Mall, Malad West** further enhances the desirability of this location. The area boasts a 4.2, making it ideal for those seeking convenient access to the wider city. The 400104 ensures efficient postal services and area identification. This development offers a blend of convenience and comfort.\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Arkade Evoke.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Arkade Evoke](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/arkade-evoke-project-project-large-image1-3647-opt-c75b9731-6102-4ad8-b813-7615ba802861.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Bangur Nagar Vidya Bhavan\n\n#### Krishna Leela Housing Society\n\n#### Prarthana Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Goregaon West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nEasy access to Western & Eastern Express Highways, JVLR\n\nTraffic congestion\n\nGoregaon West is appealing because my experiences feel cozy and dynamic. Metro access, good schools, grocery stores, and close by hospitals are all available. Parks and shopping centers are where I enjoy family time. I live near Andheri and arrive promptly. Traffic snarls and noise, though, need rapid handling.\n\n— Kalpesh Shah, Tenant\n\nTrust & Verification\n\n## RERA Details of Arkade Evoke\n\n**Arkade Evoke** is currently New Launch, ensuring a smooth transition for future residents. 145 residential units are thoughtfully designed, keeping in mind the needs of modern families.\n\nThe development is fully compliant with regulatory standards, as evidenced by its RERA