arine Lines\n\n📅 28 Sep 2026](/news/2001893/dhuleva-plans-1-000-crore-redevelopment-near-marine-lines)[![BMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/a5490eaafe8c.png)\n\nArticles\n\nBMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001930/bmc-begins-fresh-sea-level-risk-assessment-for-mumbai)[![MahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/499075ce4cdd.png)\n\nArticles\n\nMahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001927/maharera-orders-l-t-to-fix-defects-at-crescent-bay-parel)[![GIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8d8e7c8b42a9.png)\n\nArticles\n\nGIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra\n\n📅 05 Sep 2026](/news/2001922/gis-maps-to-be-attached-to-sale-deeds-from-october-in-maharashtra)","images":[]},{"url":"https://arkade.in/arkade-evoke","title":"Arkade Evoke Goregaon West | Luxspacious 2 & 3 Bed Residences ...","raw_content":"[ENQUIRE NOW](#lead-popup) [CHAT WITH US](https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=919222892229&text=Hi)\n\n[![Arkade Logo](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/family-first-main.webp)](https://arkade.in/ \"Arkade Developers\")\n\n### [Arkade Developers](https://arkade.in/ \"Arkade Developers\")\n\nTop Real Estate Builder and Developer in Mumbai\n\n[![Arkade Logo](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/family-first-main.webp)](https://arkade.in/ \"Arkade Developers\")\n\n### [Arkade Developers](https://arkade.in/ \"Arkade Developers\")\n\nTop Real Estate Builder and Developer in Mumbai\n\n![Arkade Evoke Logo](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/arkade-evoke-logo-png-rkdzmly2na3davo1ztwgpderuy2kn0k2qi0wjlo9fa.png \"arkade-evoke-logo-png\")\n\n## Where Everyday Living Becomes Eventful\n\nWelcome to **Arkade Evoke**, a premium residential address located in **Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West**. Thoughtfully designed for modern city living, the project offers **luxspacious 2 and 3 bed residences** that combine comfort, connectivity, and lifestyle amenities.\n\nSet in one of the well-connected neighbourhoods of Mumbai, Arkade Evoke allows residents to enjoy everyday convenience while experiencing a lifestyle where ordinary moments turn into memorable events.\n\n![Arkade Evoke Logo](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/arkade-evoke-logo-png-rkdzmly2na3davo1ztwgpderuy2kn0k2qi0wjlo9fa.png \"arkade-evoke-logo-png\")\n\n[![Arkade Evoke Logo](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/arkade-evoke-logo-png.png)](#main)\n\n## Overview\n\nArkade Evoke is a thoughtfully planned residential development designed for people who value comfort, accessibility, and lifestyle experiences. Located in **Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West**, and close to the [**Arkade Bangur Nagar Metro Station**](https://youtube.com/shorts/pCVqFzjtQtI?si=51XuKBy1QqGit1oI), the project offers **luxspacious 2 and 3 bed residences** complemented by modern amenities and open spaces. Marking **Arkade’s 8th project in this well-connected neighbourhood**, Arkade Evoke continues the developer’s vision of creating thoughtfully designed homes in prime city locations.\n\nWith a **vehicular-free eco deck and curated lifestyle amenities**, Arkade Evoke creates an environment where residents can relax, socialize, and enjoy everyday living within the community.\n\n## Configuration\n\n### 2 & 3 BHK\n\n## RERA Possession\n\n### June 2029\n\n## Location\n\n### Goregaon (W), Mumbai\n\n## Explore Project\n\n[### Visit Microsite](https://arkadeevoke.com/)\n\n## Construction Update\n\n### August 2026\n\n## Amenities\n\n![HOBBY ROOM](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Hobby-Room-scaled.jpg)\n\nHOBBY ROOM\n\n![LAP POOL](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Swimming-pool-close-up-scaled.jpg)\n\nLAP POOL\n\n![FITNESS CENTER](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Fitness-Center-scaled.jpg)\n\nFITNESS CENTER\n\n![MULTIPURPOSE HALL](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Multipurpose-Hall-1-scaled.jpg)\n\nMULTIPURPOSE HALL\n\n## Gallery\n\n![SIDE DAY VIEW](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Front-day-left-view-scaled.jpg)\n\nSIDE DAY VIEW\n\n![FRONT NIGHT VIEW](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Front-Night-view-scaled.jpg)\n\nFRONT NIGHT VIEW\n\n![WORM VIEW](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/worm-view-scaled.jpg)\n\nWORM VIEW\n\n![AERIAL VIEW](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Aerial-view-scaled.jpg)\n\nAERIAL VIEW\n\n## Location\n\nStrategically located in **Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West**, **Arkade Evoke** enjoys the advantage of being in one of the city’s well-connected neighbourhoods. With **Link Road and Metro connectivity nearby**, travelling to important parts of Mumbai becomes convenient for residents. The location allows you to spend less time commuting and more time enjoying everyday life.\n\n* **Education & Colleges** – 10 mins\n* **Shopping & Malls** – 5 mins\n* **Restaurants & Hotels** – 8 mins\n* **Hospitals & Healthcare** – 10 mins\n* **Link Road** – 3 mins\n* **Metro Connectivity** – 5 mins\n\n![](https://arkade.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Evoke.jpg.jpeg)\n\n## Arkade Evoke Rera Details\n\nMahaRERA registration number – **PR1180002502642**available on the website **<https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>** under registered projects.  \nCorporate Address :-\n\nArkade House, Next to Children’s Academy, Ashok Nagar, Kandivali (E), Mumbai – 400 101.\n\nSite Address:- Arkade Evoke, Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400104\n\n**Disclaimer:** The images, layouts, and other details in this advertisement are indicative and for representational purposes only. Arkade Developers reserve the right to make changes or improvements as required. Actual project features may differ from those depicted. This advertisement does not constitute an offer or contract.\n\n## FAQs\n\nWhat types of apartments are available at Evoke by Arkade Developers?\n\nEvoke by Arkade Developers offers thoughtfully designed for modern city living, luxspacious 2 and 3 bed residences that combine comfort, connectivity, and lifestyle amenities.\n\nWhere is the Evoke by Arkade Developer located in Mumbai?\n\nArkade Evoke, a premium residential address located in Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West. It offers easy access to major landmarks, [Arkade Bangur Nagar Metro Station](https://www.youtube.com/shorts/pCVqFzjtQtI?si=51XuKBy1QqGit1oI), schools, hospitals, and shopping areas in the city.\n\nWhat is the target completion date for the apartments in Evoke?\n\nThe apartments in Evoke by Arkade Developers are expected to be completed by June 2029. The project is progressing steadily, aiming to offer residents a modern, ready-to-move-in experience upon possession.\n\nIs Evoke - Arkade Developers a RERA registered project?\n\nYes, Evoke by Arkade Developers is a RERA registered project, ensuring full compliance with real estate regulations and providing transparency and security for buyers. The project registration no. is PR1180002502642 and the details are available at <https://maharera.mahaonline.gov.in/> .\n\nHow can a new buyer purchase a flat in Evoke - Arkade Developers?\n\nTo purchase a flat in Arkade Evoke, a new buyer can visit the official Arkade Developers website or visit sales office at site for detailed information on available units, pricing, and the booking process.\n\nWhat are the nearby landmarks, schools, hospitals, and malls?\n\n**Nearby Hospitals** –\n\nKapadia Multispecialty Hospital, SRV Hospital, Sun Multispecialty Hospital, Lifeline Medicare Hospital\n\n**Nearby Schools** –\n\nVIBGYOR High School, St. Johan’s Universal School\n\n**Nearby Malls** –\n\nD Mart, Westside, Inorbit Mall, Infiniti Mall2, Oberoi Mall\n\nIs there a clubhouse at Evoke?\n\nEvoke by Arkade Developers does not have a dedicated clubhouse. However, It offers a range of recreational facilities, including a swimming pool, gym, indoor games, Cricket Pitch, pickleball court etc for residents to enjoy.\n\nWhat security features are provided at Evoke - Arkade Developers?\n\nEvoke by Arkade Developers provides strong security with 24/7 CCTV cameras, security guards at the entrance, and controlled access to ensure the safety of all residents.\n\nIs there an option for customization of flats at Evoke - Arkade Developers?\n\nCurrently, Evoke by Arkade Developers does not offer customization options for individual flats. All units come with thoughtfully designed layouts and premium specifications that are pre-finalized to ensure a high-quality and uniform living experience for residents.\n\nAre there any additional charges apart from the price of the apartment?\n\nGenerally, in addition to the apartment’s price, buyers may encounter additional charges such as Goods and Services Tax (GST), stamp duty, registration fees, maintenance deposits, and charges for amenities or parking. It’s advisable to consult the sales team at Arkade Developers for specific details related to Evoke by Arkade developers.\n\nWhat is the booking amount for an apartment?\n\nThe specific booking amount for an apartment at Evoke by Arkade Developers is not provided in the available information. Typically, booking amounts vary based on the project and the type of apartment. For accurate details, it’s best to contact sales team of Evoke by Arkade Developers or visit the official website. They can provide the most current and relevant information regarding the booking amount for their apartments.\n\n## About Us\n\nMenu\n\n## Investor Relations\n\nMenu\n\n## Projects\n\nMenu\n\n## Find Your Perfect Home\n\nMenu\n\n[Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/arkadedevelopersltd/)     [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/ArkadeGroup/)     [Linkedin](https://www.linkedin.com/company/arkade-developers/)     [Youtube](https://www.youtube.com/c/ArkadeGr